  "title": "Yonkers Rises",
  "content": "<p><strong>Tool:</strong> <a href=\"https://tools.simonwillison.net/yonkers-rises\">Yonkers Rises</a></p>\n        <p>I realized I didn't know where Yonkers was, so I looked it up on Google Maps and then, to help embed its location and shape in my head (and to try out Claude Fable 5.2's 3D modeling and animation skills), I <a href=\"https://claude.ai/share/97443910-2e0a-4e17-9b9e-11d14d8ff65c\">prompted Fable 5.2 Medium</a> to:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><code>Make a three js animation where yonkers stands up as a big mech (cool stand up motion) and átomos around manhattan and queens and Brooklyn, use openstreetmap mapping data</code></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>It correctly deduced that \"átomos\" was a mobile keyboard typo for \"stomps\":</p>\n<video controls=\"controls\" height=\"360\" poster=\"https://static.simonwillison.net/static/2026/yonkers.webp\" preload=\"none\" width=\"572\">\n  <source src=\"https://static.simonwillison.net/static/2026/yonkers-large.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" />\n</video>\n    \n    \n        <p>Tags: <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/three-js\">three-js</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/llms\">llms</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/ai\">ai</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/generative-ai\">generative-ai</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/claude-mythos-fable\">claude-mythos-fable</a></p>",
